  "steps": [
    "Unroll the wire mesh and cut six lengths, each 6 ft long and 3 ft tall.",
    "Bend each length into a cylinder, overlapping the cut ends and wiring them together.",
    "Crimp the top ring of each cage to a 5 ft circle so the plant grows up the centre.",
    "Drive a 6 ft stake beside each cage and tie the stake to the cage at two heights."
